			"notes": "Alpha release for Minecraft 1.21 to 1.21.8.\n\nSame features as the 1.21.9 plus build, ported to the older input system.\n\nAdded\n- In-game Bug-o-pedia browser with search, bug list, and details pane\n- Filters for confirmation, resolution, and version, plus seven sort orders\n- Live bug list with offline cache, refreshes on its own\n- Workarounds, fix versions, and clickable report links\n- Click sounds and tooltips\n\nThe Modrinth release is still waiting on approval. This GitHub release has the same files."
		},
